('2a97249a-c087-5ef0-a2aa-e6a0a23b732c','01d102f3-0e3a-55be-8d97-80b4f5791bff',1,'crime/accident','جنایت/حادثه','spoken & written','someone who sees a crime or an accident and can describe what happened','[ countable ]','eyewitness','شاهد، وابسته (پرونده)؛ شاهد (رویداد)؛ شاهد (حالت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Police have appealed for witnesses to come forward.","translation":"پلیس از شاهدان درخواست کرده است که حضور پیدا کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000494555.mp3"},{"sentence":"One witness to the accident said the driver appeared to be drunk.","translation":"یکی از شاهدان حادثه گفت که راننده به نظر مست بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001626824.mp3"},{"sentence":"an eye witness (= someone who sees an event ) to the robbery","translation":"شاهد عینی (= کسی که واقعه ای را می بیند) دزدی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001820163.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('e2596df2-e100-5ce4-a5a9-7514213536cf','01d102f3-0e3a-55be-8d97-80b4f5791bff',2,'in a court of law','در یک دادگاه حقوقی','spoken & written','someone who appears in a court of law to say what they know about a crime or other event','[ countable ]','expert witness','کسی که در دادگاه حاضر می شود تا آنچه را که در مورد جرم یا رویداد دیگری می داند بگوید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a key witness (= a very important witness ) Rupert is expected to be a key witness at the trial.','a star witness (= an important witness who says things that help one side a lot ) The judge ruled that the state’s star witness had lied on the stand.','a principal witness (= a main witness ) The principal witness was too ill to testify.','an expert witness (= someone who has special knowledge, for example of medicine, and who talks about it in court ) The jury had to choose between the conflicting testimonies of expert witnesses.','a character witness (= a witness who says that the person being tried is a good person ) He said he would gladly be a character witness for her.','a prosecution witness During the trial, over thirty prosecution witnesses were called.','a defence witness A defence witness said that Carter was not holding a gun when the shot was fired.','a witness for the prosecution/defence Witnesses for the prosecution have not sounded convincing.','call a witness (= require a witness to speak in court ) She was the final witness to be called.','question a witness They were not permitted to question government witnesses.','cross-examine a witness (= ask them questions about what they have said ) His attorney cross-examined the witness.','appear as a witness He appeared as an expert witness at several government enquiries.','a witness testifies (= makes a statement ) We had two witnesses who testified that they had seen him hitting his wife.','a witness gives evidence Child witnesses gave evidence using closed circuit television cameras.','the witness box/stand (= where the witness sits when speaking in court ) He spent three hours in the witness stand.','the statement/testimony of a witness (= what a witness says ) The testimony of one witness led to his conviction.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the key witness in the case against the brothers","translation":"شاهد کلیدی در پرونده علیه برادران","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001820170.mp3"},{"sentence":"The defence is expected to call them as witnesses .","translation":"انتظار می رود که دفاع آنها را به عنوان شاهد فراخواند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020336.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('659b599e-ab8d-5ce7-889e-4490b7f20ee0','01d102f3-0e3a-55be-8d97-80b4f5791bff',3,'signing a document','امضای یک سند','spoken & written','someone who is present when an official document is signed , and who signs it too, to say that they saw it being signed','[ countable ]',null,'کسی که هنگام امضای یک سند رسمی حضور دارد و آن را نیز امضا می کند تا بگوید که امضای آن را دیده است.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a witness to a will","translation":"شاهد یک وصیت نامه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001626834.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
