('b303658b-ff73-5993-bee3-a0b0b9e80c18','3d3a173e-88ea-505c-bd0e-8bc11fd8900d',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the worried well','نگران، دلسوخته؛ دلواپس (حالت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['very/really worried We were really worried about him during the divorce.','increasingly worried The family became increasingly worried about her safety.','seriously/deeply worried Hazel was now seriously worried. Why hadn’t he come back?','desperately worried (= extremely worried ) All this time I was desperately worried about my family.','a little/slightly worried ( also a bit worried British English ) I was a bit worried about my exams.','not unduly worried (= not very worried ) Jerry did not sound unduly worried at the prospect of going to jail.','be worried I was so worried!','get/become worried You should have called me. I was getting worried.','look worried Don’t look so worried! It’ll be fine.','worried sick/stiff (= extremely worried ) Where have you been? We’ve been worried sick!','a worried expression/look John came in with a worried look on his face.','a worried frown Her worried frown deepened.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e2a3d76c-768b-5f47-9196-25634445cf00','ccdb1386-1d5f-5392-a498-523f92238bb2',1,null,null,'spoken & written','words that have been written or printed','[ uncountable ]',null,'نوشتار، خط؛ نوشتار (رسمی)؛ اثر (نویسنده)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"What does the writing on the back say?","translation":"نوشته پشتش چی میگه؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000504937.mp3"},{"sentence":"a T-shirt with Japanese writing on it","translation":"یک تی شرت با نوشته ژاپنی روی آن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661323.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('4c14ebad-5c4a-5b14-8277-4208f27f3a4f','ccdb1386-1d5f-5392-a498-523f92238bb2',2,null,null,'spoken & written','books, poems , articles etc, especially those by a particular writer or about a particular subject','[ uncountable ]',null,'کتاب‌ها، شعرها، مقالات و غیره، به‌ویژه آنهایی که نویسنده‌ای خاص یا درباره موضوعی خاص هستند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['creative writing (= the writing of fiction ) He is currently teaching creative writing at the University of Michigan.','travel writing Here is some of the best travel writing from around the globe.','historical/sociological/scientific etc writing Much historical writing today looks at the lives of ordinary people, as well as at the rich and powerful.','academic writing In academic writing, you should avoid contractions such as "don''t" or "aren''t".','feminist writing Feminist writing has strongly criticized pornography as treating women as objects rather than people.','writing materials (= pens, pencils, paper etc ) Pupils were able to try old writing materials such as slates and steel-nibbed pens.','writing skills a workshop to develop children''s writing skills','writing style Different newspapers tend to use different writing styles.','a piece of writing It''s a brilliant piece of writing.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Some of his most powerful writing is based on his childhood experiences.","translation":"برخی از قدرتمندترین نوشته های او بر اساس تجربیات دوران کودکی او است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000504948.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('713936bf-e3c6-5780-b7c9-f3b85f1ca6da','ccdb1386-1d5f-5392-a498-523f92238bb2',3,null,null,'spoken & written','the activity of writing books, stories etc','[ uncountable ]',null,'فعالیت نوشتن کتاب، داستان و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['creative writing (= the writing of fiction ) He is currently teaching creative writing at the University of Michigan.','travel writing Here is some of the best travel writing from around the globe.','historical/sociological/scientific etc writing Much historical writing today looks at the lives of ordinary people, as well as at the rich and powerful.','academic writing In academic writing, you should avoid contractions such as "don''t" or "aren''t".','feminist writing Feminist writing has strongly criticized pornography as treating women as objects rather than people.','writing materials (= pens, pencils, paper etc ) Pupils were able to try old writing materials such as slates and steel-nibbed pens.','writing skills a workshop to develop children''s writing skills','writing style Different newspapers tend to use different writing styles.','a piece of writing It''s a brilliant piece of writing.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"In 1991 she retired from politics and took up writing as a career.","translation":"در سال 1991 از سیاست بازنشسته شد و به عنوان یک حرفه نویسندگی را آغاز کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000504952.mp3"},{"sentence":"a short story that stands out as a brilliant piece of writing","translation":"داستان کوتاهی که به عنوان یک نوشته درخشان برجسته می شود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661324.mp3"},{"sentence":"a class in creative writing (= a subject studied at school or college, where you write your own stories, poems etc )","translation":"کلاس نویسندگی خلاق (= موضوعی که در مدرسه یا کالج مطالعه می شود، جایی که شما داستان ها، شعرهای خود را می نویسید و غیره)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661327.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('fdb6192f-b8c0-5cd7-a87a-0586f528452f','ccdb1386-1d5f-5392-a498-523f92238bb2',4,null,null,'spoken & written','the particular way that someone writes with a pen or pencil','[ uncountable ]',null,'روش خاصی که کسی با خودکار یا مداد می نویسد',array['handwriting']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Your writing is very neat.","translation":"نوشته شما بسیار زیباست","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000504957.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('5edccbf6-6c1f-5868-ac36-ea90278295ce','ccdb1386-1d5f-5392-a498-523f92238bb2',5,null,null,'spoken & written','the skill of writing','[ uncountable ]',null,'مهارت نوشتن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"At this age we concentrate on the children’s reading and writing skills.","translation":"در این سن ما روی مهارت های خواندن و نوشتن کودکان تمرکز می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661336.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
