('23ae4201-64ba-5386-a6bb-e99836ca3aae','9ae29daa-be56-572e-8c4f-eaa0edcd4fd9',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to introduce a statement that makes your main statement seem surprising or unlikely',null,null,'اگرچه، هرچند؛ اما (پایان جمله)',array['though']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Although in poor health, she continued to carry out her duties.","translation":"او اگرچه در وضعیت سلامتی ضعیفی قرار داشت، به انجام وظایف خود ادامه داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841192.mp3"},{"sentence":"We decided to take rooms in Longwood House, although we knew we could not really afford the rent.","translation":"تصمیم گرفتیم در لانگ‌وود هاوس اتاق بگیریم، اگرچه می‌دانستیم که واقعاً نمی‌توانیم هزینه اجاره را بپردازیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001630711.mp3"},{"sentence":"Although I can’t help admiring the man’s courage, I do not approve of his methods.","translation":"اگرچه نمی توانم شجاعت این مرد را تحسین نکنم، اما روش های او را تایید نمی کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841193.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('38eec500-3692-54de-806b-8a0d02462608','9ae29daa-be56-572e-8c4f-eaa0edcd4fd9',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used to add a statement that balances or reduces the effect of what you have just said',null,null,'برای افزودن عبارتی استفاده می شود که تأثیر آنچه را که گفتید متعادل یا کاهش می دهد',array['but']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"You can copy down my answers, although I’m not sure they’re right.","translation":"می‌توانید پاسخ‌های من را کپی کنید، اگرچه مطمئن نیستم که درست باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000937917.mp3"},{"sentence":"No, this is my responsibility, although I appreciate your offer.","translation":"نه، این مسئولیت من است، اگرچه از پیشنهاد شما قدردانی می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000937918.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('8f62bb88-fe46-5523-81f7-95a0a82a88fb','5a9a6ce4-2c25-5ca3-8bdb-349cd38cc7b4',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a strong desire to achieve something','[ countable ]',null,'جاه‌طلبی، بلندپروازی؛ آرزوی بزرگ','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['somebody’s ambition is to be/do something My ambition was to be a journalist.','have an ambition He had an ambition to be a top cello player.','achieve/fulfil/realize your ambition (= do what you wanted to do ) It took her ten years to achieve her ambition. He was prepared to go to any lengths to fulfil his ambition. I want to thank all those who made it possible for me to realize a lifetime’s ambition.','lack ambition/have no ambition Many of the students lack ambition.','nurse/harbour/cherish an ambition (= have it for a long time, especially secretly ) He had nursed an ambition to become a writer for many years.','frustrate/thwart somebody’s ambitions formal (= prevent someone from achieving them ) The weather threatened to frustrate their ambitions. Her lifelong ambitions had been thwarted again and again.','somebody’s main ambition What’s your main ambition in life?','somebody’s great ambition He didn’t achieve his greatest ambition – to be Wimbledon Champion.','a lifelong/long-held ambition (= one that you have had all your life ) It’s been her lifelong ambition to work with horses.','a personal ambition Crossing the Sahara was a personal ambition of mine.','a secret ambition His secret ambition was to become a pilot.','a burning/driving ambition (= a very strong ambition ) She had a burning ambition to become a racing car driver.','career ambitions The course is designed to help you achieve your career ambitions.','political/presidential ambitions His political ambitions were put on hold while he waited for a suitable opportunity.','somebody’s dreams and ambitions He told her all about his dreams and ambitions.','somebody’s lack of ambition I was frustrated by their apparent lack of ambition.','be full of ambition She was full of ambition when she joined the company.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She had always had an ambition to be a pilot.","translation":"او همیشه آرزوی خلبان شدن را داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000061.mp3"},{"sentence":"An injury ended his ambitions of becoming a professional footballer.","translation":"یک مصدومیت به جاه طلبی های او برای تبدیل شدن به یک فوتبالیست حرفه ای پایان داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000062.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0683e3a7-2311-54f1-893c-083c6efda8d3','5a9a6ce4-2c25-5ca3-8bdb-349cd38cc7b4',2,null,null,'spoken & written','determination to be successful , rich , powerful etc','[ uncountable ]',null,'عزم برای موفق بودن، ثروتمند بودن، قدرتمند بودن و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['somebody’s ambition is to be/do something My ambition was to be a journalist.','have an ambition He had an ambition to be a top cello player.','achieve/fulfil/realize your ambition (= do what you wanted to do ) It took her ten years to achieve her ambition. He was prepared to go to any lengths to fulfil his ambition. I want to thank all those who made it possible for me to realize a lifetime’s ambition.','lack ambition/have no ambition Many of the students lack ambition.','nurse/harbour/cherish an ambition (= have it for a long time, especially secretly ) He had nursed an ambition to become a writer for many years.','frustrate/thwart somebody’s ambitions formal (= prevent someone from achieving them ) The weather threatened to frustrate their ambitions. Her lifelong ambitions had been thwarted again and again.','somebody’s main ambition What’s your main ambition in life?','somebody’s great ambition He didn’t achieve his greatest ambition – to be Wimbledon Champion.','a lifelong/long-held ambition (= one that you have had all your life ) It’s been her lifelong ambition to work with horses.','a personal ambition Crossing the Sahara was a personal ambition of mine.','a secret ambition His secret ambition was to become a pilot.','a burning/driving ambition (= a very strong ambition ) She had a burning ambition to become a racing car driver.','career ambitions The course is designed to help you achieve your career ambitions.','political/presidential ambitions His political ambitions were put on hold while he waited for a suitable opportunity.','somebody’s dreams and ambitions He told her all about his dreams and ambitions.','somebody’s lack of ambition I was frustrated by their apparent lack of ambition.','be full of ambition She was full of ambition when she joined the company.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He was young and full of ambition.","translation":"او جوان و پر از جاه طلبی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000063.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('6b3e8011-4d93-5ec8-93d3-3230fcf65969','5a9a6ce4-2c25-5ca3-8bdb-349cd38cc7b4',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'have no ambition to do something','جاه‌طلبی، بلندپروازی؛ آرزوی بزرگ','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('9161341e-b222-58f5-9ace-78c0a2c808e4','1a469f15-2d2d-5914-82c1-76fe71e46b75',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a careful examination of something in order to understand it better','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'تحلیل، واکاوی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a detailed/in-depth analysis a detailed analysis of the firm’s earnings','an in-depth analysis (= detailed analysis ) an in-depth analysis of global warming','a careful/close analysis Students learn to make a close analysis of the texts.','a brief analysis Let’s start with a brief analysis of the situation.','statistical analysis (= using statistics ) Their research was based on statistical analysis.','a critical analysis (= that makes judgements about how good or bad something is ) Write a critical analysis of the following poem.','economic/political/scientific etc analysis His book provided a scientific analysis of human behaviour.','data analysis the use of databases for data analysis','be based on an analysis of something This work has been based entirely on an analysis of large mammals.','do/carry out/perform/conduct an analysis No similar analysis has been done in this country.','provide/produce an analysis The report provided an analysis of the problems we need to address.','an analysis shows something DNA analysis shows that the blood and the saliva come from the same person.','an analysis suggests/indicates something Our analysis suggests that these problems are widespread.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a detailed analysis of the week’s news","translation":"تحلیل دقیق اخبار هفته","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000939812.mp3"},{"sentence":"Further analysis of the data is needed.","translation":"تجزیه و تحلیل بیشتر داده ها مورد نیاز است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001738598.mp3"},{"sentence":"They were doing some type of statistical analysis .","translation":"آنها در حال انجام نوعی تجزیه و تحلیل آماری بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001738601.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do you agree with Marx’s analysis of the failure of free-market capitalism?","translation":"آیا با تحلیل مارکس از شکست سرمایه داری بازار آزاد موافق هستید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001738609.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('794ee96a-fe1d-50e9-a4e7-cef484e9ec37','1a469f15-2d2d-5914-82c1-76fe71e46b75',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a careful examination of a substance to see what it is made of','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'بررسی دقیق یک ماده برای دیدن اینکه از چه چیزی ساخته شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a detailed/in-depth analysis a detailed analysis of the firm’s earnings','an in-depth analysis (= detailed analysis ) an in-depth analysis of global warming','a careful/close analysis Students learn to make a close analysis of the texts.','a brief analysis Let’s start with a brief analysis of the situation.','statistical analysis (= using statistics ) Their research was based on statistical analysis.','a critical analysis (= that makes judgements about how good or bad something is ) Write a critical analysis of the following poem.','economic/political/scientific etc analysis His book provided a scientific analysis of human behaviour.','data analysis the use of databases for data analysis','be based on an analysis of something This work has been based entirely on an analysis of large mammals.','do/carry out/perform/conduct an analysis No similar analysis has been done in this country.','provide/produce an analysis The report provided an analysis of the problems we need to address.','an analysis shows something DNA analysis shows that the blood and the saliva come from the same person.','an analysis suggests/indicates something Our analysis suggests that these problems are widespread.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"analysis of genetic material","translation":"تجزیه و تحلیل مواد ژنتیکی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000939817.mp3"},{"sentence":"Blood samples were sent for analysis.","translation":"نمونه های خون برای تجزیه و تحلیل ارسال شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001738613.mp3"},{"sentence":"You’ll get the results when the analysis is complete.","translation":"وقتی تجزیه و تحلیل کامل شد، نتایج را دریافت خواهید کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001738617.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('c6d06a95-5573-58d2-a8f9-76cf9f13a529','1a469f15-2d2d-5914-82c1-76fe71e46b75',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a process in which a doctor makes someone talk about their past experiences, relationships etc in order to help them with mental or emotional problems','[ uncountable ]',null,'فرآیندی که در آن پزشک کسی را وادار می کند تا در مورد تجربیات گذشته، روابط و غیره صحبت کند تا به او در مشکلات روحی یا عاطفی کمک کند.',array['psychoanalysis']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a detailed/in-depth analysis a detailed analysis of the firm’s earnings','an in-depth analysis (= detailed analysis ) an in-depth analysis of global warming','a careful/close analysis Students learn to make a close analysis of the texts.','a brief analysis Let’s start with a brief analysis of the situation.','statistical analysis (= using statistics ) Their research was based on statistical analysis.','a critical analysis (= that makes judgements about how good or bad something is ) Write a critical analysis of the following poem.','economic/political/scientific etc analysis His book provided a scientific analysis of human behaviour.','data analysis the use of databases for data analysis','be based on an analysis of something This work has been based entirely on an analysis of large mammals.','do/carry out/perform/conduct an analysis No similar analysis has been done in this country.','provide/produce an analysis The report provided an analysis of the problems we need to address.','an analysis shows something DNA analysis shows that the blood and the saliva come from the same person.','an analysis suggests/indicates something Our analysis suggests that these problems are widespread.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She’s been in analysis for three years.","translation":"او سه سال است که در حال تجزیه و تحلیل است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001738618.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('6e034fcf-6904-5c69-9ddb-d9bbe7094a75','1a469f15-2d2d-5914-82c1-76fe71e46b75',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'in the final/last analysis','تحلیل، واکاوی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a detailed/in-depth analysis a detailed analysis of the firm’s earnings','an in-depth analysis (= detailed analysis ) an in-depth analysis of global warming','a careful/close analysis Students learn to make a close analysis of the texts.','a brief analysis Let’s start with a brief analysis of the situation.','statistical analysis (= using statistics ) Their research was based on statistical analysis.','a critical analysis (= that makes judgements about how good or bad something is ) Write a critical analysis of the following poem.','economic/political/scientific etc analysis His book provided a scientific analysis of human behaviour.','data analysis the use of databases for data analysis','be based on an analysis of something This work has been based entirely on an analysis of large mammals.','do/carry out/perform/conduct an analysis No similar analysis has been done in this country.','provide/produce an analysis The report provided an analysis of the problems we need to address.','an analysis shows something DNA analysis shows that the blood and the saliva come from the same person.','an analysis suggests/indicates something Our analysis suggests that these problems are widespread.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('49b47d88-52cc-5d9d-8d09-4a2fc07db7ac','34c6c6d8-1289-5441-b9b7-130494834388',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to officially tell people about something, especially about a plan or a decision',null,null,'اعلام کردن، رسماً خبر دادن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They announced their engagement in ‘The Times’.","translation":"آنها نامزدی خود را در \"تایمز\" اعلام کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000940936.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government has announced plans to create 10,000 new jobs.","translation":"دولت برای ایجاد 10000 شغل جدید اعلام کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656693.mp3"},{"sentence":"A government spokesman announced that the hostages had been released.","translation":"سخنگوی دولت از آزادی گروگان ها خبر داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000940939.mp3"},{"sentence":"At the end of their meeting, it was announced that an agreement had been reached.","translation":"در پایان جلسه آنها اعلام شد که توافق حاصل شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656696.mp3"},{"sentence":"Cordon announced his resignation to staff members on Wednesday.","translation":"کوردون روز چهارشنبه استعفای خود را به کارکنان اعلام کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656702.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('42195021-81c5-5ba6-ac52-e2f91f192b53','34c6c6d8-1289-5441-b9b7-130494834388',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to say something, especially something that other people will not like, in a loud and confident way',null,null,'گفتن چیزی، به ویژه چیزی که دیگران آن را دوست ندارند، با صدای بلند و مطمئن',array['state']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘I’m not going to their party, ’ Maggie announced.","translation":"مگی اعلام کرد: \"من به مهمانی آنها نمی روم.\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656703.mp3"},{"sentence":"He stood up and announced that he was ready to go.","translation":"برخاست و اعلام کرد که آماده رفتن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001656706.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('72d6764a-d294-55ab-b49a-fa395fdd37aa','34c6c6d8-1289-5441-b9b7-130494834388',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to give information to people using a loudspeaker or microphone , especially at an airport or railway station',null,null,'برای دادن اطلاعات به افراد با استفاده از بلندگو یا میکروفون، به ویژه در فرودگاه یا ایستگاه راه آهن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We arrived just as they were announcing the arrival of Flight 207 from Minneapolis.","translation":"درست زمانی رسیدیم که از مینیاپولیس خبر رسیدن پرواز 207 را می دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000940959.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
