('fe9a787a-627f-53bf-b47e-b7ed40818708','68fb102b-92cd-5d1b-8ee0-9a73c0e37c89',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a room where there is a toilet',null,null,'اتاقی که در آن توالت وجود دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Where’s the bathroom?","translation":"حمام کجاست؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001004112.mp3"},{"sentence":"I really need to go to the bathroom (= use a toilet ) .","translation":"من واقعاً نیاز دارم به دستشویی بروم (= استفاده از توالت).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658886.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('1eef6508-bde9-52b3-99d8-e25a49f40b06','ab6bc519-7ed2-57d6-bb7a-b956b941e3e3',1,null,null,'spoken & written','your birthday is a day that is an exact number of years after the day you were born',null,null,'روز تولد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['somebody’s first/18th/40th etc birthday It’s Mum’s 50th birthday tomorrow.','Happy Birthday! (= said to someone on their birthday ) Happy Birthday, Linda!','have a good/nice etc birthday Did you have a nice birthday?','get something for your birthday What did you get for your birthday?','celebrate somebody’s birthday He will celebrate his 90th birthday on 25th August.','remember somebody’s birthday (= remember to send a card or present ) She always remembers my birthday.','forget somebody’s birthday (= forget to send a card or present ) Oh no! I forgot his birthday.','give something to somebody for their birthday I never know what to give him for his birthday.','a birthday card Don’t forget to send her a birthday card.','a birthday present Have you got Lou a birthday present yet?','a birthday party Can you come to my birthday party next Saturday?','a birthday cake She had a birthday cake with 21 silver candles on it.','birthday celebrations the president’s 60th birthday celebrations','a birthday treat (= something special you do on your birthday ) What would you like to do for a birthday treat?','a birthday meal Where are you going for your birthday meal?','the birthday girl/boy informal (= the person whose birthday it is ) Here comes the birthday girl!']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s my birthday on Monday.","translation":"روز دوشنبه تولد منه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000180.mp3"},{"sentence":"My aunt called to wish me a happy birthday.","translation":"خاله زنگ زد و تولدم را تبریک گفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000181.mp3"},{"sentence":"Anne’s birthday party","translation":"جشن تولد آنا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001674170.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('9c62c54d-1b8c-5518-9b88-2efe55feffa8','ab6bc519-7ed2-57d6-bb7a-b956b941e3e3',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a day that is an exact number of years since an organization was established or an event first happened',null,null,'روزی که عدد دقیقی از سال‌هایی است که یک سازمان تأسیس شده یا یک رویداد برای اولین بار اتفاق افتاده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['somebody’s first/18th/40th etc birthday It’s Mum’s 50th birthday tomorrow.','Happy Birthday! (= said to someone on their birthday ) Happy Birthday, Linda!','have a good/nice etc birthday Did you have a nice birthday?','get something for your birthday What did you get for your birthday?','celebrate somebody’s birthday He will celebrate his 90th birthday on 25th August.','remember somebody’s birthday (= remember to send a card or present ) She always remembers my birthday.','forget somebody’s birthday (= forget to send a card or present ) Oh no! I forgot his birthday.','give something to somebody for their birthday I never know what to give him for his birthday.','a birthday card Don’t forget to send her a birthday card.','a birthday present Have you got Lou a birthday present yet?','a birthday party Can you come to my birthday party next Saturday?','a birthday cake She had a birthday cake with 21 silver candles on it.','birthday celebrations the president’s 60th birthday celebrations','a birthday treat (= something special you do on your birthday ) What would you like to do for a birthday treat?','a birthday meal Where are you going for your birthday meal?','the birthday girl/boy informal (= the person whose birthday it is ) Here comes the birthday girl!']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The City of Cleveland Orchestra is celebrating its 200th birthday .","translation":"ارکستر شهر کلیولند دویستمین سالگرد تولد خود را جشن می گیرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001674179.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('525757b5-a7a6-5bb5-bbbe-d3b9a36d15e9','ab6bc519-7ed2-57d6-bb7a-b956b941e3e3',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'in your birthday suit','روز تولد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['somebody’s first/18th/40th etc birthday It’s Mum’s 50th birthday tomorrow.','Happy Birthday! (= said to someone on their birthday ) Happy Birthday, Linda!','have a good/nice etc birthday Did you have a nice birthday?','get something for your birthday What did you get for your birthday?','celebrate somebody’s birthday He will celebrate his 90th birthday on 25th August.','remember somebody’s birthday (= remember to send a card or present ) She always remembers my birthday.','forget somebody’s birthday (= forget to send a card or present ) Oh no! I forgot his birthday.','give something to somebody for their birthday I never know what to give him for his birthday.','a birthday card Don’t forget to send her a birthday card.','a birthday present Have you got Lou a birthday present yet?','a birthday party Can you come to my birthday party next Saturday?','a birthday cake She had a birthday cake with 21 silver candles on it.','birthday celebrations the president’s 60th birthday celebrations','a birthday treat (= something special you do on your birthday ) What would you like to do for a birthday treat?','a birthday meal Where are you going for your birthday meal?','the birthday girl/boy informal (= the person whose birthday it is ) Here comes the birthday girl!']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f265aad0-9ae3-58ae-92dc-189497201870','bac6076f-5dd0-5771-8328-4514656724d6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a structure such as a house, church , or factory , that has a roof and walls','[ countable ]',null,'ساختمان، بنا؛ ساختن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['put up a building ( also erect a building formal ) They keep pulling down the old buildings and putting up new ones.','pull down/knock down/tear down a building All the medieval buildings were torn down.','demolish/destroy a building (= pull it down ) Permission is needed to demolish listed buildings.','a tall building The park was surrounded by tall buildings.','a high-rise building (= very tall with many floors ) a New York high-rise building','a low building That low building is a stable block.','an office/school/hospital etc building Our office building is just ten minutes’ walk from where I live.','a public building The town has a number of interesting public buildings, including the old town hall.','a beautiful building ( also a fine/handsome building British English ) The old station was a fine building, but has sadly been demolished.','an impressive/imposing building the impressive buildings around the town’s central square','a brick/stone/wooden building The farmhouse is a long stone building about a century old.','a two-storey/three-storey etc building (= with two, three etc floors ) Our villa was a delightful two-storey building.','a single-storey/one-storey building (= with only one floor )','a historic building (= an old building of historical interest ) Most of the historic buildings are from the 18th century.','a listed building British English (= a historic building that is protected by a government order ) The school is actually a listed building.','a derelict building (= empty and in very bad condition ) Near the canal there are a number of derelict buildings.','a dilapidated building (= in bad condition ) He rented an apartment at the top of a dilapidated building in Paris.','a ramshackle building ( also a tumbledown building British English ) (= old and almost falling down ) The farm was surrounded by tumbledown buildings.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The offices are on the top two floors of the building.","translation":"دفاتر در دو طبقه بالای ساختمان هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001663572.mp3"},{"sentence":"a farmhouse and other farm buildings","translation":"یک خانه مزرعه و سایر ساختمان های مزرعه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001663573.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('af00ade1-24d1-5dc9-86f3-72b169f20d50','bac6076f-5dd0-5771-8328-4514656724d6',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the process or business of building things','[ uncountable ]',null,'فرآیند یا کسب و کار ساخت اشیا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['put up a building ( also erect a building formal ) They keep pulling down the old buildings and putting up new ones.','pull down/knock down/tear down a building All the medieval buildings were torn down.','demolish/destroy a building (= pull it down ) Permission is needed to demolish listed buildings.','a tall building The park was surrounded by tall buildings.','a high-rise building (= very tall with many floors ) a New York high-rise building','a low building That low building is a stable block.','an office/school/hospital etc building Our office building is just ten minutes’ walk from where I live.','a public building The town has a number of interesting public buildings, including the old town hall.','a beautiful building ( also a fine/handsome building British English ) The old station was a fine building, but has sadly been demolished.','an impressive/imposing building the impressive buildings around the town’s central square','a brick/stone/wooden building The farmhouse is a long stone building about a century old.','a two-storey/three-storey etc building (= with two, three etc floors ) Our villa was a delightful two-storey building.','a single-storey/one-storey building (= with only one floor )','a historic building (= an old building of historical interest ) Most of the historic buildings are from the 18th century.','a listed building British English (= a historic building that is protected by a government order ) The school is actually a listed building.','a derelict building (= empty and in very bad condition ) Near the canal there are a number of derelict buildings.','a dilapidated building (= in bad condition ) He rented an apartment at the top of a dilapidated building in Paris.','a ramshackle building ( also a tumbledown building British English ) (= old and almost falling down ) The farm was surrounded by tumbledown buildings.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There is a limited supply of land for building.","translation":"تعداد محدودی زمین برای ساخت و ساز وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000908915.mp3"},{"sentence":"stone, timber, and other building materials","translation":"سنگ، چوب و سایر مصالح ساختمانی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000908916.mp3"},{"sentence":"The enquiry recommended the building of a tunnel.","translation":"این تحقیق ساخت یک تونل را توصیه کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001663576.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b1383c6e-b20a-5ee1-82f6-a4d1dcef46b0','ccf53c76-5466-5d3e-bb68-9b2368a84252',1,'buying or selling goods or services','خرید یا فروش کالا یا خدمات','spoken & written','the activity of making money by producing or buying and selling goods, or providing services','[ uncountable ]',null,'کسب‌وکار، تجارت؛ شرکت؛ کار و رویدادهای کاری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['do business A lot of firms are keen to do business in Japan.','conduct business formal (= do business ) It is not a sensible way to conduct business.','go into business (= start working in business ) A lot of university graduates want to go into business.','set up/start up in business The bank gave me a loan to help me set up in business.','stay in business (= continue operating and not become bankrupt ) Even if they manage to stay in business for another year, their long-term survival remains under threat. Some stores are finding it hard to stay in business.','go out of business (= stop doing business because of financial problems ) In a recession smaller firms often go out of business.','the music/entertainment/computer etc business He started out working in the computer business.','a business deal (= an occasion when you buy or sell something ) Negotiation is the most important part of a business deal.','business activities His wife refused to get involved in his business activities.','business interests (= business activities, or shares in companies ) Both companies have substantial business interests in Indonesia.','the business community (= people who work in business ) There was pressure on the government from the business community.','the business world You need to be flexible in today’s highly competitive business world.','business studies (= a course of study about business ) She did business studies at college.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Students on the course learn about all aspects of business.","translation":"دانش آموزان در این دوره با تمام جنبه های تجارت آشنا می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001046946.mp3"},{"sentence":"Carl began in the music business by running a recording studio.","translation":"کارل با اداره یک استودیوی ضبط موسیقی شروع به کار کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786321.mp3"},{"sentence":"We do business with a number of Italian companies.","translation":"ما با تعدادی از شرکت های ایتالیایی تجارت می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786315.mp3"},{"sentence":"He has a wide range of business interests.","translation":"او طیف وسیعی از علایق تجاری دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786324.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tourism is good for business.","translation":"گردشگری برای تجارت خوب است.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
('8e72490e-57c3-5f98-a8e2-bc635f922cb0','ccf53c76-5466-5d3e-bb68-9b2368a84252',2,'company','شرکت','spoken & written','an organization such as a company, shop , or factory that produces or sells goods or provides a service','[ countable ]',null,'سازمانی مانند شرکت، مغازه یا کارخانه ای که کالاها را تولید یا می فروشد یا خدماتی ارائه می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She now has her own $25 million home-shopping business.","translation":"او اکنون تجارت 25 میلیون دلاری خود را برای خرید خانه دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786330.mp3"},{"sentence":"They don’t know how to run a business.","translation":"آنها نمی دانند چگونه یک تجارت را اداره کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786339.mp3"},{"sentence":"The company began as a small family business.","translation":"این شرکت به عنوان یک تجارت کوچک خانوادگی شروع به کار کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786331.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('89580688-caaa-5c33-acd9-7062abafc115','ccf53c76-5466-5d3e-bb68-9b2368a84252',3,'how much work a company has','یک شرکت چقدر کار دارد','spoken & written','the amount of work a company does or the amount of money it makes','[ uncountable ]',null,'میزان کاری که یک شرکت انجام می دهد یا مقدار پولی که به دست می آورد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We’re now doing twice as much business as we did last year.","translation":"ما در حال حاضر دو برابر بیشتر از سال گذشته کسب و کار انجام می دهیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001046973.mp3"},{"sentence":"Exports account for 72% of overall business.","translation":"صادرات 72 درصد از کل تجارت را تشکیل می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786349.mp3"},{"sentence":"Business is slow during the summer.","translation":"تجارت در تابستان کند است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001046976.mp3"},{"sentence":"Perot was in Europe, drumming up business for his new investment company.","translation":"پروت در اروپا بود و برای شرکت سرمایه گذاری جدید خود کار می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001046980.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('475ebc39-2c03-5266-9ae4-08486730eb3d','ccf53c76-5466-5d3e-bb68-9b2368a84252',4,'for your job','برای شغل شما','spoken & written','work that you do as part of your job','[ uncountable ]',null,'کاری که به عنوان بخشی از کار خود انجام می دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She’s in New York this week on business (= for her work ) .","translation":"او این هفته برای کاری (= برای کارش) در نیویورک است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786351.mp3"},{"sentence":"Hi Maggie! Is this phone call business or pleasure ?","translation":"سلام مگی! این تماس تلفنی کار است یا لذت؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786355.mp3"},{"sentence":"We discussed the idea over a business lunch.","translation":"ما این ایده را در یک ناهار تجاری مورد بحث قرار دادیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001046992.mp3"},{"sentence":"useful business contacts","translation":"مخاطبین تجاری مفید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786359.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('4a16e1fc-c967-5d43-8c43-0a5d1b39c406','ccf53c76-5466-5d3e-bb68-9b2368a84252',5,'what someone should be involved in','چه کسی باید درگیر آن باشد','spoken & written','if something is not your business or none of your business, you should not be involved in it or ask about it','[ uncountable ]',null,'اگر چیزی به شما مربوط نیست یا به شما مربوط نیست، نباید در آن دخالت داشته باشید یا در مورد آن بپرسید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It was not her business, she decided, to ask where the money came from.","translation":"تصمیم گرفت که بپرسد این پول از کجا آمده است، کار او نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786370.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s none of your business how much I weigh.","translation":"به تو ربطی نداره من چقدر وزن دارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786378.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Who’s that girl you were with?’ ‘ Mind your own business (= Don’t ask questions about something that does not concern you ) !’","translation":"«آن دختری که با او بودی کیست؟» «به کار خودت فکر کن (= درباره چیزی که به تو مربوط نیست سؤال نپرس!»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786385.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Are you going out with Kate tonight?’ ‘ That’s my business (= it doesn’t concern you, so don’t ask me questions about it ) ’.","translation":"«امشب با کیت بیرون می‌روی؟» «این کار من است (= به تو ربطی ندارد، پس در مورد آن از من سؤال نپرس».","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786382.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is the business of government to listen to the various groups within society.","translation":"این وظیفه دولت است که به گروه های مختلف جامعه گوش دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786373.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('727a9b69-4c67-5c78-8cc8-cb70b3ed27f3','ccf53c76-5466-5d3e-bb68-9b2368a84252',6,'things to be dealt with','مواردی که باید با آنها برخورد کرد','spoken & written','things that need to be done or discussed','[ uncountable ]',null,'کارهایی که باید انجام شود یا بحث شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Okay, let’s get down to business (= start doing or discussing something ) .","translation":"خوب، بیایید کار را شروع کنیم (= شروع به انجام یا بحث در مورد چیزی کنیم).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786390.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Is there any other business ?’ the chairman asked.","translation":"رئیس پرسید: آیا کار دیگری وجود دارد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786395.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b1e64274-27a2-595a-9d7a-b6afea633e8e','ccf53c76-5466-5d3e-bb68-9b2368a84252',7,'matter','موضوع','spoken & written','a situation or activity, especially one that you have a particular opinion about or attitude towards','[ singular ]',null,'موقعیت یا فعالیتی، به ویژه موقعیتی که نظر یا نگرش خاصی نسبت به آن دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Leon regards keeping fit as a serious business.","translation":"لئون حفظ تناسب اندام را یک تجارت جدی می داند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001786406.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tanya found the whole business ridiculous.","translation":"تانیا کل تجارت را مضحک یافت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001047018.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
