('010a8016-7454-5cc4-9ea5-eea1721337c3','e0be716c-dbbc-5ee1-9c60-f812473304c5',5,'somebody controlled by something','کسی که توسط چیزی کنترل می شود','spoken & written','someone who is controlled or influenced a lot by something',null,null,'کسی که تحت کنترل یا تحت تأثیر قرار می گیرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a living creature The early Greeks believed that plants were living creatures that felt pain and pleasure.','a little/small/tiny creature tiny creatures such as mice','a beautiful/magnificent creature The buffalo is a magnificent creature.','a wild creature Damage to the environment affects all wild creatures.','a sea/marine creature ( also an ocean creature ) The first living creatures were marine creatures.','a furry creature Town dwellers see the squirrel as a cute furry creature, but to farmers they’re a pest.','a dangerous creature dangerous creatures such as tigers','a nocturnal creature (= awake at night and sleeping in the day ) As darkness falls, nocturnal creatures begin to make an appearance.','a primitive/simple creature (= one with only a few cells ) primitive creatures like bacteria','a complex creature (= consisting of many different parts ) Human beings are extremely complex creatures.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He was a creature of the military government.","translation":"او مخلوق حکومت نظامی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001119071.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('9bb2c370-c37e-59f2-8cb1-757d997f1e4b','e0be716c-dbbc-5ee1-9c60-f812473304c5',6,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'beautiful/stupid/adorable etc creature','مخلوق، جاندار؛ موجود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a living creature The early Greeks believed that plants were living creatures that felt pain and pleasure.','a little/small/tiny creature tiny creatures such as mice','a beautiful/magnificent creature The buffalo is a magnificent creature.','a wild creature Damage to the environment affects all wild creatures.','a sea/marine creature ( also an ocean creature ) The first living creatures were marine creatures.','a furry creature Town dwellers see the squirrel as a cute furry creature, but to farmers they’re a pest.','a dangerous creature dangerous creatures such as tigers','a nocturnal creature (= awake at night and sleeping in the day ) As darkness falls, nocturnal creatures begin to make an appearance.','a primitive/simple creature (= one with only a few cells ) primitive creatures like bacteria','a complex creature (= consisting of many different parts ) Human beings are extremely complex creatures.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('01d028de-0db1-5ed8-bbb8-43d2f87cdd35','4f5d65bd-8f42-5835-adf7-6739fe9f2eb1',1,null,null,'spoken & written','relating to crime',null,null,'مجرمانه، کیفری؛ گناهکار','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['criminal activity There was no evidence of any criminal activity.','a criminal offence/act (= a crime ) Cruelty to animals is a criminal offence.','criminal behaviour Is it possible that the tendency to criminal behaviour is inherited?','criminal wrongdoing American English (= actions that are illegal ) The investigation cleared him of any criminal wrongdoing.','criminal damage British English (= damaging someone''s property illegally ) He was charged with criminal damage to his boss''s car.','criminal negligence (= not taking enough care to protect people you are responsible for ) Charges of criminal negligence were brought against senior staff.','a criminal investigation (= when a possible crime is investigated ) The FBI is conducting a criminal investigation into the bombing.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Experts cannot agree on the causes of criminal behaviour .","translation":"کارشناسان نمی توانند در مورد علل رفتار مجرمانه به توافق برسند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000846370.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was sure he was involved in some kind of criminal activity .","translation":"مطمئن بودم که او درگیر نوعی فعالیت مجرمانه بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755935.mp3"},{"sentence":"She has not committed a criminal offence (= a crime ) .","translation":"مرتکب جرم (= جنایت) نشده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755939.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was arrested and charged with criminal damage (= damaging someone’s property illegally ) .","translation":"او دستگیر و متهم به خسارت مجرمانه (= آسیب رساندن به اموال شخصی به طور غیرقانونی) شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755944.mp3"},{"sentence":"The doctor was found guilty of criminal negligence (= not taking enough care to protect people you are responsible for ) .","translation":"دکتر به دلیل سهل انگاری مجرمانه (= عدم مراقبت کافی برای محافظت از افرادی که شما مسئول آنها هستید) مجرم شناخته شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755949.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('cc045f92-6e9a-5f23-b463-aad1be7bdfdd','4f5d65bd-8f42-5835-adf7-6739fe9f2eb1',2,null,null,'spoken & written','relating to the part of the legal system that is concerned with crime',null,null,'مربوط به بخشی از نظام حقوقی که با جرم مرتبط است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The case will be tried in a criminal court .","translation":"پرونده در دادگاه کیفری رسیدگی خواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755954.mp3"},{"sentence":"We have no faith in the criminal justice system .","translation":"ما هیچ اعتقادی به سیستم عدالت کیفری نداریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040019.mp3"},{"sentence":"The police are investigating the matter, and he may face criminal charges (= be officially accused of a crime ) .","translation":"پلیس در حال بررسی موضوع است و ممکن است او با اتهامات جنایی روبرو شود (= رسما متهم به جرم شود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755962.mp3"},{"sentence":"She usually deals with serious criminal cases .","translation":"او معمولاً با پرونده های جنایی جدی سر و کار دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755967.mp3"},{"sentence":"a criminal lawyer","translation":"یک وکیل جنایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755971.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('55b4baa9-7a64-5e7f-a8cf-8c086af8741b','4f5d65bd-8f42-5835-adf7-6739fe9f2eb1',3,null,null,'spoken & written','wrong, dishonest , and unacceptable',null,null,'اشتباه، غیر صادقانه و غیر قابل قبول',array['wicked']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It seems criminal that teachers are paid so little money.","translation":"به نظر جرم است که معلمان پول کمی دریافت می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000846404.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('35186a4e-6b41-53ec-9c4d-2ad35a4fff7f','416ee8bb-5fc4-5255-ad3b-7e014473b294',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who is involved in illegal activities or has been proved guilty of a crime',null,null,'کسی که در فعالیت های غیرقانونی شرکت دارد یا جرم او ثابت شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Police have described the man as a violent and dangerous criminal.","translation":"پلیس این مرد را یک جنایتکار خشن و خطرناک توصیف کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755979.mp3"},{"sentence":"a convicted criminal (= someone who has been found guilty of a crime )","translation":"مجرم محکوم (= کسی که به جرمی مجرم شناخته شده است)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755980.mp3"},{"sentence":"The new law will ensure that habitual criminals (= criminals who commit crimes repeatedly ) receive tougher punishments than first-time offenders.","translation":"قانون جدید تضمین می کند که مجرمان معمولی (= مجرمانی که به طور مکرر مرتکب جنایت می شوند) مجازات های سخت تری نسبت به مجرمان بار اول دریافت می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755984.mp3"},{"sentence":"Teenagers should not be sent to prison to mix with hardened criminals (= criminals who have committed and will continue to commit a lot of crimes ) .","translation":"نوجوانان را نباید برای اختلاط با جنایتکاران سرسخت (= جنایتکارانی که مرتکب جنایات زیادی شده اند و خواهند کرد) روانه زندان کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755989.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('674eb682-7869-5719-97c6-26cc70adbb7f','08c11dc6-2abf-551a-b03e-90b400f8a1ee',1,'criticizing','انتقاد کردن','spoken & written','if you are critical, you criticize someone or something',null,null,'منتقدانه؛ بحرانی، سرنوشت‌ساز','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Many economists are critical of the government’s economic policies.","translation":"بسیاری از اقتصاددانان از سیاست های اقتصادی دولت انتقاد می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001119546.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many parents are strongly critical of the school.","translation":"بسیاری از والدین به شدت از مدرسه انتقاد می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001756441.mp3"},{"sentence":"He made some highly critical remarks.","translation":"او سخنان بسیار انتقادی را بیان کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001756445.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('11810f07-2b33-5f4b-b016-b727337cf223','08c11dc6-2abf-551a-b03e-90b400f8a1ee',2,'important','مهم است','spoken & written','something that is critical is very important because what happens in the future depends on it',null,null,'چیزی که حیاتی است بسیار مهم است زیرا آنچه در آینده اتفاق می افتد به آن بستگی دارد',array['crucial']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"These talks are critical to the future of the peace process.","translation":"این گفتگوها برای آینده روند صلح حیاتی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001756452.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is absolutely critical for us to know the truth.","translation":"برای ما کاملاً حیاتی است که حقیقت را بدانیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001756453.mp3"},{"sentence":"Foreign trade is of critical importance to the economy.","translation":"تجارت خارجی برای اقتصاد اهمیت حیاتی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001756457.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('8c7299c8-be7a-539b-a77e-ab316b74bfc6','08c11dc6-2abf-551a-b03e-90b400f8a1ee',3,'serious/worrying','جدی/نگران کننده','spoken & written','a critical time or situation is serious and worrying because things might suddenly become much worse',null,null,'یک زمان یا موقعیت بحرانی جدی و نگران کننده است زیرا ممکن است اوضاع ناگهان بسیار بدتر شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The fighting has stopped, but the situation is still critical.","translation":"درگیری متوقف شده است، اما وضعیت همچنان بحرانی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001756462.mp3"},{"sentence":"changes that took place during the critical period at the end of the war","translation":"تغییراتی که در دوره حساس پایان جنگ رخ داد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001756463.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('64838c78-092e-5f16-898d-fe2c2957d4ff','08c11dc6-2abf-551a-b03e-90b400f8a1ee',4,'ill','بیمار','spoken & written','so ill that you might die',null,null,'آنقدر بد است که ممکن است بمیری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He is still in a critical condition in hospital.","translation":"وی همچنان در شرایط وخیم در بیمارستان به سر می برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001756469.mp3"},{"sentence":"She is in intensive care, where she remains critical but stable.","translation":"او در بخش مراقبت های ویژه است، جایی که وضعیت وخیم اما پایدار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001756468.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('d18f425f-ad1f-5b71-86c8-c2924ca6302b','08c11dc6-2abf-551a-b03e-90b400f8a1ee',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the critical list','منتقدانه؛ بحرانی، سرنوشت‌ساز','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('86e4921c-ccc4-598e-879d-9cc23ba942fc','08c11dc6-2abf-551a-b03e-90b400f8a1ee',6,'making judgments','قضاوت کردن','spoken & written','making careful judgments about how good or bad something is',null,null,'قضاوت دقیق در مورد خوب یا بد بودن چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"His book provides a critical analysis of the television industry in Britain.","translation":"کتاب او تحلیلی انتقادی از صنعت تلویزیون در بریتانیا ارائه می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001119574.mp3"},{"sentence":"She looked round the room with a critical eye .","translation":"او با چشم انتقادی به اطراف اتاق نگاه کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001756474.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('d7e68157-c6a6-5c56-b2ed-e579976a5087','08c11dc6-2abf-551a-b03e-90b400f8a1ee',7,'art/literature','هنر/ادبیات','spoken & written','according to critics who give judgments about art , films , theatre , and books',null,null,'به گفته منتقدانی که درباره هنر، فیلم، تئاتر و کتاب قضاوت می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The book came out last year to great critical acclaim (= critics said it was very good ) .","translation":"این کتاب سال گذشته با استقبال زیادی از منتقدان روبه‌رو شد (= منتقدان گفتند خیلی خوب بود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001756479.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her first play was a critical success (= critics said it was good ) .","translation":"اولین نمایشنامه او از نظر انتقادی موفقیت آمیز بود (= منتقدان گفتند خوب بود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001756486.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0f3cbd0f-072c-54c3-89a1-8c19fcf67f7d','ff85e591-d598-57c4-9f50-afee1ad4fc65',1,null,null,'spoken & written','belonging or relating to a particular society and its way of life',null,'multicultural','فرهنگی، فرهنگی (مراسم، تفاوت‌ها)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['cultural heritage (= the ideas, customs etc that have existed among a group for a long time ) We want to preserve our cultural heritage and pass it on to our children.','cultural differences People must accept each others’ cultural differences.','cultural values (= ideas of what is right and wrong in a culture ) the social and cultural values of the western world','cultural identity (= feeling of belonging to a particular group and sharing its values ) Children develop a sense of their racial and cultural identity at a young age.','cultural diversity (= including people from many different cultures ) the racial and cultural diversity of British society','a cultural context (= the ideas, customs etc of a particular place or time ) the cultural context of Europe in the eighteenth century','cultural change These were decades of rapid cultural change.','cultural background (= the type of society you come from, and its ideas, customs etc ) people from the same cultural background','cultural factors/influences Research suggests that cultural factors influence scores in intelligence tests.','cultural traditions The ceremony is an important cultural tradition for the tribe.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the very real historical and cultural differences between our two societies","translation":"تفاوت های تاریخی و فرهنگی بسیار واقعی بین دو جامعه ما","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001748273.mp3"},{"sentence":"the desire to maintain a distinct cultural identity","translation":"تمایل به حفظ هویت فرهنگی متمایز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001748277.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is important to look at the political and cultural context in which the novel was written.","translation":"نگاهی به بستر سیاسی و فرهنگی که رمان در آن نوشته شده است، مهم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001748280.mp3"},{"sentence":"people who share the same cultural background","translation":"افرادی که پیشینه فرهنگی مشابهی دارند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001748284.mp3"},{"sentence":"Japan’s unique cultural heritage","translation":"میراث فرهنگی منحصر به فرد ژاپن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001748287.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('6e187327-921f-59b8-8719-4765e018d700','ff85e591-d598-57c4-9f50-afee1ad4fc65',2,null,null,'spoken & written','relating to art , literature , music etc',null,null,'مربوط به هنر، ادبیات، موسیقی و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['cultural heritage (= the ideas, customs etc that have existed among a group for a long time ) We want to preserve our cultural heritage and pass it on to our children.','cultural differences People must accept each others’ cultural differences.','cultural values (= ideas of what is right and wrong in a culture ) the social and cultural values of the western world','cultural identity (= feeling of belonging to a particular group and sharing its values ) Children develop a sense of their racial and cultural identity at a young age.','cultural diversity (= including people from many different cultures ) the racial and cultural diversity of British society','a cultural context (= the ideas, customs etc of a particular place or time ) the cultural context of Europe in the eighteenth century','cultural change These were decades of rapid cultural change.','cultural background (= the type of society you come from, and its ideas, customs etc ) people from the same cultural background','cultural factors/influences Research suggests that cultural factors influence scores in intelligence tests.','cultural traditions The ceremony is an important cultural tradition for the tribe.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the city’s rich and varied cultural life","translation":"زندگی فرهنگی غنی و متنوع شهر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001748288.mp3"},{"sentence":"Students need to have time for relaxation and cultural activities , as well as for academic work.","translation":"دانش آموزان باید برای استراحت و فعالیت های فرهنگی و همچنین برای کارهای آکادمیک وقت داشته باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001748291.mp3"},{"sentence":"In the later Middle Ages, Prague was an important cultural centre (= a place, usually a big city, where a lot of artistic and musical events happen ) .","translation":"در اواخر قرون وسطی، پراگ یک مرکز فرهنگی مهم (= مکانی، معمولاً یک شهر بزرگ، که در آن رویدادهای هنری و موسیقی زیادی رخ می دهد) بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000828110.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('bddb7524-dd61-5b3b-a041-2c74d3cec128','89426448-5c2a-5a3a-a19b-b68ea4e63a9d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a piece of furniture with doors , and sometimes shelves , used for storing clothes , plates , food etc',null,null,'کابینت، کمد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a kitchen cupboard The kitchen cupboards were empty.','a bathroom/hall/bedroom cupboard British English Your boots are in the hall cupboard.','a built-in/fitted cupboard British English (= ones that are there permanently and cannot be moved ) The kitchen has built-in cupboards.','a wall cupboard British English (= fixed to the wall, not on the floor ) Wall cupboards provide extra storage in the garage.','a storage cupboard British English (= for storing things ) There''s a storage cupboard under the stairs.','a food/medicine/clothes cupboard British English The medicine cupboard''s in the bathroom.','a drinks cupboard British English (= for drinks, especially alcoholic ones ) He went to the drinks cupboard and poured a whisky.','an airing cupboard British English (= a warm cupboard for sheets and towels )','a linen cupboard British English (= for sheets and towels )','a broom cupboard (= for brushes and other things you use to clean the house )','a bedside cupboard British English (= a small cupboard beside a bed )']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s in the kitchen cupboard.","translation":"در کمد آشپزخانه است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000828366.mp3"},{"sentence":"The cupboard doors were open.","translation":"درهای کمد باز بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000828367.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('3bd6c38c-11d5-5282-818d-2ec0d723b68a','89426448-5c2a-5a3a-a19b-b68ea4e63a9d',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the cupboard is bare','کابینت، کمد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('85cae44f-cd50-529a-be93-81e3ff42d0cc','7c2e779b-9dd6-5f41-890c-defc3ee9c87f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the system or type of money that a country uses','[ countable, uncountable ]','hard currency','واحد پول (کشور)؛ پول رایج','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['foreign currency (= the type of money that other countries use ) You can buy foreign currency at the post office.','the local/national currency (= the type of money that a particular country uses ) The local currency of Zambia is the ''kwacha''.','a single currency (= one currency for the countries in Europe ) Britain does not use the single currency.','a hard/strong currency (= currency from a country with a strong economy ) They accept American dollars and other hard currencies.','weak (= from a country with a weak economy ) The fund was set up to support weak currencies.','stable (= not likely to rise or fall suddenly ) The government want to maintain a stable currency.','change/convert currency (= change money from one currency to another ) There’s usually a charge for converting currencies.','devalue the currency (= reduce the value of a country’s money in relation to other currencies ) The Finance Minister was forced to devalue the currency.','a currency rises/falls (= it goes up or down in relation to other currencies ) The currency fell from 144 to the dollar twelve months ago to 812.','currency exchange (= the process of changing from one country’s currency to another ) Banks make good profits on currency exchange.','the currency markets (= the financial markets where currencies are bought and sold ) the dollar’s recent rise on the currency markets','currency movements/fluctuations (= changes in the values of currencies ) Global trends such as oil prices influence currency movements.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The bank can supply you with foreign currency .","translation":"بانک می تواند ارز شما را تامین کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000828949.mp3"},{"sentence":"The euro is the single currency for 12 of the European Union’s 15 member states.","translation":"یورو واحد پول 12 کشور از 15 کشور عضو اتحادیه اروپا است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00220.mp3"},{"sentence":"The local currency is the Swiss franc.","translation":"واحد پول محلی فرانک سوئیس است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001692407.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('ce0542ef-2047-5b1a-9697-08f7d0fb0f92','7c2e779b-9dd6-5f41-890c-defc3ee9c87f',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the state of being accepted or used by a lot of people','[ uncountable ]',null,'حالت پذیرفته شدن یا استفاده توسط افراد زیادی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['foreign currency (= the type of money that other countries use ) You can buy foreign currency at the post office.','the local/national currency (= the type of money that a particular country uses ) The local currency of Zambia is the ''kwacha''.','a single currency (= one currency for the countries in Europe ) Britain does not use the single currency.','a hard/strong currency (= currency from a country with a strong economy ) They accept American dollars and other hard currencies.','weak (= from a country with a weak economy ) The fund was set up to support weak currencies.','stable (= not likely to rise or fall suddenly ) The government want to maintain a stable currency.','change/convert currency (= change money from one currency to another ) There’s usually a charge for converting currencies.','devalue the currency (= reduce the value of a country’s money in relation to other currencies ) The Finance Minister was forced to devalue the currency.','a currency rises/falls (= it goes up or down in relation to other currencies ) The currency fell from 144 to the dollar twelve months ago to 812.','currency exchange (= the process of changing from one country’s currency to another ) Banks make good profits on currency exchange.','the currency markets (= the financial markets where currencies are bought and sold ) the dollar’s recent rise on the currency markets','currency movements/fluctuations (= changes in the values of currencies ) Global trends such as oil prices influence currency movements.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The argument has received wide currency .","translation":"استدلال ارز گسترده ای دریافت کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001692411.mp3"},{"sentence":"Marxism began to gain currency .","translation":"مارکسیسم شروع به کسب ارزش کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001692414.mp3"},{"sentence":"The idea was common currency in European political life.","translation":"این ایده پول رایج در زندگی سیاسی اروپا بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001692417.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('e86a2937-c0fa-5b2d-901b-7758eb834012','667ca510-1cc9-523e-9a5f-117c3394317d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who buys goods or services from a shop , company etc',null,null,'مشتری، خریدار؛ مصرف‌کننده','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a regular customer My business quickly built up a base of regular customers.','a good customer (= who buys a lot from you, or uses your service a lot ) Good products attract good customers.','a major/big/large customer (= who is important and buys a lot ) America is a big customer for Japanese goods.','a loyal customer (= who has been a customer for a long time ) Some of our loyal customers have been coming here since the store opened.','a satisfied customer (= who is pleased with your goods or service ) Satisfied customers will return again and again.','a potential/prospective customer (= who might become a customer in the future ) It’s very important to establish contact with potential customers.','a business customer (= customers that are businesses ) the bank’s major business customers','existing customers (= that you already have ) We want to improve our service for both new and existing customers.','deal with a customer (= do business with or talk to a customer ) He has a lot of experience in dealing with customers.','serve a customer Every day the shop serves around 800 customers.','attract customers (= get more customers ) The Internet is a great way to attract new customers.','keep/retain customers Keeping prices low helps to retain customers.','lose a customer The company has lost some big customers in the last two years.','customer service/care (= serving and looking after customers ) Our aim is always to raise the level of customer service.','customer relations Staff are given training in customer relations.','customer satisfaction (= how pleased customers are ) The firm carried out a survey of customer satisfaction.','customer demand (= the amount of something customers want to buy or use ) It’s important to respond quickly to changing customer demand.','customer complaints My job is to handle customer complaints and enquiries.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We aim to offer good value and service to all our customers.","translation":"هدف ما ارائه ارزش و خدمات خوب به همه مشتریان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001123107.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’ve had several letters from satisfied customers.","translation":"ما چندین نامه از مشتریان راضی دریافت کرده ایم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001123108.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many of the banks offer a poor level of customer service.","translation":"بسیاری از بانک ها سطح پایینی از خدمات مشتریان را ارائه می دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001692714.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s one of our regular customers .","translation":"او یکی از مشتریان همیشگی ماست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001692715.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('1cd722d4-08b3-54e0-9d3c-3675378142d2','667ca510-1cc9-523e-9a5f-117c3394317d',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'awkward/tricky/tough etc customer','مشتری، خریدار؛ مصرف‌کننده','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a regular customer My business quickly built up a base of regular customers.','a good customer (= who buys a lot from you, or uses your service a lot ) Good products attract good customers.','a major/big/large customer (= who is important and buys a lot ) America is a big customer for Japanese goods.','a loyal customer (= who has been a customer for a long time ) Some of our loyal customers have been coming here since the store opened.','a satisfied customer (= who is pleased with your goods or service ) Satisfied customers will return again and again.','a potential/prospective customer (= who might become a customer in the future ) It’s very important to establish contact with potential customers.','a business customer (= customers that are businesses ) the bank’s major business customers','existing customers (= that you already have ) We want to improve our service for both new and existing customers.','deal with a customer (= do business with or talk to a customer ) He has a lot of experience in dealing with customers.','serve a customer Every day the shop serves around 800 customers.','attract customers (= get more customers ) The Internet is a great way to attract new customers.','keep/retain customers Keeping prices low helps to retain customers.','lose a customer The company has lost some big customers in the last two years.','customer service/care (= serving and looking after customers ) Our aim is always to raise the level of customer service.','customer relations Staff are given training in customer relations.','customer satisfaction (= how pleased customers are ) The firm carried out a survey of customer satisfaction.','customer demand (= the amount of something customers want to buy or use ) It’s important to respond quickly to changing customer demand.','customer complaints My job is to handle customer complaints and enquiries.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('a29f5504-2ca5-544c-aaa5-612aab00b4f0','4eab1eca-5fb5-5057-9f20-2c5a054de175',1,null,null,'spoken & written','when there is no light',null,null,'تاریکی، ظلمت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['complete/total darkness It was late and all the houses in the village were in total darkness.','pitch darkness (= complete darkness ) We ended up coming down the mountain in pitch darkness.','deep/thick darkness literary: All around her was the deep darkness of a winter night.','gathering/growing darkness literary (= night that is slowly coming ) The garden was almost invisible now in the gathering darkness.','darkness falls/comes ( also darkness descends literary ) As darkness fell, rescue workers had to give up the search.','darkness closes in literary (= it becomes darker outside ) The rain turned to snow and darkness closed in.','be plunged into darkness (= be suddenly in darkness because the lights go out ) Suddenly the electricity went off and we were plunged into darkness.','the hours of darkness (= the night ) Desert animals come out during the hours of darkness when its cool.','under cover of darkness (= when darkness makes you less likely to be seen ) The attack was planned to take place under cover of darkness.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the long hours of darkness during winter","translation":"ساعات طولانی تاریکی در زمستان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799102.mp3"},{"sentence":"The lamp suddenly went out, leaving us in darkness.","translation":"لامپ ناگهان خاموش شد و ما را در تاریکی رها کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799105.mp3"},{"sentence":"The room was in total darkness.","translation":"اتاق در تاریکی مطلق بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799108.mp3"},{"sentence":"We lit our campfire as darkness fell (= it became night ) .","translation":"تاریکی (= شب شد) آتش خود را روشن کردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000833039.mp3"},{"sentence":"He stared out the window at the gathering darkness (= the night slowly coming ) .","translation":"از پنجره به تاریکی جمع شده خیره شد (= شبی که آرام آرام می آمد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799113.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('0209ce1a-0a29-5e8b-b7d2-f7ea2e1937e8','4eab1eca-5fb5-5057-9f20-2c5a054de175',2,null,null,'spoken & written','evil or the devil',null,null,'شیطان یا شیطان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['complete/total darkness It was late and all the houses in the village were in total darkness.','pitch darkness (= complete darkness ) We ended up coming down the mountain in pitch darkness.','deep/thick darkness literary: All around her was the deep darkness of a winter night.','gathering/growing darkness literary (= night that is slowly coming ) The garden was almost invisible now in the gathering darkness.','darkness falls/comes ( also darkness descends literary ) As darkness fell, rescue workers had to give up the search.','darkness closes in literary (= it becomes darker outside ) The rain turned to snow and darkness closed in.','be plunged into darkness (= be suddenly in darkness because the lights go out ) Suddenly the electricity went off and we were plunged into darkness.','the hours of darkness (= the night ) Desert animals come out during the hours of darkness when its cool.','under cover of darkness (= when darkness makes you less likely to be seen ) The attack was planned to take place under cover of darkness.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"His smooth manner covered a heart of darkness.","translation":"رفتار صاف او قلب تاریکی را پوشانده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799118.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('8deeb5ec-8619-5757-8126-1f19bc2bc952','4eab1eca-5fb5-5057-9f20-2c5a054de175',3,null,null,'spoken & written','the dark quality of a colour',null,null,'کیفیت تیره یک رنگ','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['complete/total darkness It was late and all the houses in the village were in total darkness.','pitch darkness (= complete darkness ) We ended up coming down the mountain in pitch darkness.','deep/thick darkness literary: All around her was the deep darkness of a winter night.','gathering/growing darkness literary (= night that is slowly coming ) The garden was almost invisible now in the gathering darkness.','darkness falls/comes ( also darkness descends literary ) As darkness fell, rescue workers had to give up the search.','darkness closes in literary (= it becomes darker outside ) The rain turned to snow and darkness closed in.','be plunged into darkness (= be suddenly in darkness because the lights go out ) Suddenly the electricity went off and we were plunged into darkness.','the hours of darkness (= the night ) Desert animals come out during the hours of darkness when its cool.','under cover of darkness (= when darkness makes you less likely to be seen ) The attack was planned to take place under cover of darkness.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the darkness of the lenses","translation":"تاریکی لنزها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001799123.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('524425ff-9587-5834-8d6f-78c7c730ad33','605b8e3b-7856-5d57-b7a5-0bc145806074',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a British rock group whose songs include I Believe in a Thing called Love and Christmas Time (Don’t Let the Bells End) . The main singer is Justin Hawkins.',null,null,'یک گروه راک بریتانیایی که آهنگ‌هایش شامل I Believe in a Thing به نام عشق و کریسمس (Don’t Let the Bells End) است. خواننده اصلی جاستین هاوکینز است.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('ca758679-4366-5cce-abca-50249d6f95b9','4723773d-9963-523a-8b3e-67bd6272a777',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a large amount of data stored in a computer system so that you can find and use it easily',null,null,'پایگاه داده، بانک اطلاعاتی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"customer details held on a database","translation":"جزئیات مشتری در پایگاه داده نگهداری می شود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000833294.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('14743af8-c35f-5587-b221-fc1f1add961c','e0f54dc9-1db5-5924-b2e3-2cf781e48999',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone’s female child',null,null,'دختر (فرزند)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She’s got two daughters and one son.","translation":"او دو دختر و یک پسر دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001128950.mp3"},{"sentence":"our eldest daughter","translation":"دختر بزرگ ما","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001700703.mp3"},{"sentence":"the daughter of an English king","translation":"دختر یک پادشاه انگلیسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020052.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('05c5bc00-059a-5ea0-9772-41982d98c7bb','014fc587-7ca4-5986-906b-3b1aa8837326',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a choice or judgment that you make after a period of discussion or thought','[ countable ]',null,'تصمیم، تصمیم‌گیری؛ قاطعیت (تصمیم)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a decision I want to think about it a bit longer before I make a decision.','take a decision British English (= make an important or formal decision ) I fully accept the decision taken by the committee.','reach/come to/arrive at a decision (= make a decision after a lot of thought ) We hope they will reach their decision as soon as possible.','regret a decision (= wish you had not made a particular decision ) I was already regretting my decision to go on holiday with him.','reconsider a decision (= think about changing a decision you have made ) He said he wasn''t prepared to reconsider his decision.','reverse a decision (= change a decision ) They want him to reverse his decision to quit.','overrule/overturn a decision (= officially change a decision by another person or group ) A director of the company had overruled that decision.','postpone a decision (= not make a decision until later ) The government has postponed its decision about when to hold the election.','an important decision My father made all the important decisions.','a big decision (= an important decision ) Marriage is a big decision.','a major decision (= very important ) The government now has some major decisions to make.','a difficult/hard/tough decision In the end I took the difficult decision to retire early.','a good decision It was a good decision to change the name of the product.','a bad decision I think he made a bad decision.','the right decision She chose to study Engineering and it was definitely the right decision.','the wrong decision I thought I''d made the wrong decision marrying Jeff.','a conscious/deliberate decision (= one that you have thought about clearly ) Belinda had made a conscious decision to have a baby.','a clear/firm decision (= a definite one ) It''s now time to come to a clear decision on this.','a final decision (= one that will not be changed ) The council will make a final decision in four months.','a snap decision (= one that you make extremely quickly ) Police officers often have to make snap decisions on how to act.','a controversial decision (= that people disagree about ) The history of the law is full of controversial decisions.','a hasty decision (= one that you make without enough thought ) Don''t let yourself be forced into making hasty decisions.','a joint decision (= one that two people make together ) Jo and I made a joint decision that we should separate.','a collective decision (= one that a number of people make together ) Society should take collective decisions about individual rights and responsibilities.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Do you ever wonder if you made the right decision?","translation":"آیا تا به حال فکر کرده اید که آیا تصمیم درستی گرفته اید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000836779.mp3"},{"sentence":"She refused to discuss her decision to quit the group.","translation":"او از بحث درباره تصمیم خود برای ترک گروه خودداری کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000836775.mp3"},{"sentence":"We finally came to a firm decision on the matter.","translation":"بالاخره در این مورد به یک تصمیم قطعی رسیدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000836783.mp3"},{"sentence":"Viewers make the final decision as to who should be eliminated from the competition.","translation":"بینندگان تصمیم نهایی را می گیرند که چه کسی باید از مسابقه حذف شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001685050.mp3"},{"sentence":"The judges’ decision is final (= it will not be changed ) .","translation":"تصمیم داوران قطعی است (= تغییر نخواهد کرد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001252089.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
