e one ) It''s now time to come to a clear decision on this.','a final decision (= one that will not be changed ) The council will make a final decision in four months.','a snap decision (= one that you make extremely quickly ) Police officers often have to make snap decisions on how to act.','a controversial decision (= that people disagree about ) The history of the law is full of controversial decisions.','a hasty decision (= one that you make without enough thought ) Don''t let yourself be forced into making hasty decisions.','a joint decision (= one that two people make together ) Jo and I made a joint decision that we should separate.','a collective decision (= one that a number of people make together ) Society should take collective decisions about individual rights and responsibilities.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The Court has the ultimate power of decision.","translation":"دادگاه قدرت نهایی تصمیم گیری را دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000836810.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d56c6825-ba5e-59f9-bc80-f86bce91fce5','d4543490-81dd-5c74-9065-ada01cd4f4bd',1,null,null,'spoken & written','clearly known, seen, or stated',null,null,'قطعی، معین، روشن',array['clear']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s impossible for me to give you a definite answer.","translation":"برای من غیر ممکن است که به شما پاسخ قطعی بدهم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001684266.mp3"},{"sentence":"We need to record sufficient data to enable definite conclusions to be reached.","translation":"ما باید داده های کافی را ثبت کنیم تا بتوانیم به نتایج قطعی دست یابیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001684270.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’d shown definite signs of resigning himself to the situation.","translation":"او نشانه های قطعی از تسلیم شدن خود به این موقعیت را نشان داده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001684274.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('870643a8-7c70-5a1f-9178-b961b3bb8314','d4543490-81dd-5c74-9065-ada01cd4f4bd',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a definite arrangement , promise etc will happen in the way that someone has said',null,null,'یک ترتیب قطعی، قول و غیره به روشی که کسی گفته است اتفاق خواهد افتاد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Fix a definite date for the delivery of your computer.","translation":"یک تاریخ قطعی برای تحویل رایانه خود تعیین کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000839678.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7d24aec5-f090-5653-9a52-1a2ea61afd21','d4543490-81dd-5c74-9065-ada01cd4f4bd',3,null,null,'spoken & written','saying something very firmly so that people understand exactly what you mean','[ not before noun ]',null,'خیلی محکم چیزی بگویید تا مردم دقیقاً منظور شما را بفهمند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She’s not definite about retiring from the game.","translation":"او در مورد بازنشستگی از بازی قطعی نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000839683.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('da5785bb-d9f9-540c-b1b4-1a553aebb603','534c5b98-3e2e-5a0d-af7f-5b9351563e9f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the act of bringing goods, letters etc to a particular person or place, or the things that are brought','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'تحویل، رساندن؛ زایمان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['free (= you do not pay extra for it ) We offer free delivery anywhere in the UK. Delivery is free for purchases over £20.','special/express delivery (= that delivers mail and packages very quickly ) A brown package arrived by special delivery.','next-day delivery (= happening on the next day ) You have to pay extra for next-day delivery.','recorded delivery British English (= when a record is kept of posting and safe delivery ) I’d better send my passport by recorded delivery.','mail delivery ( also postal delivery British English ) The strike stopped mail deliveries to 20,000 homes and businesses.','parcel delivery British English (= a parcel that someone delivers to you ) I’m expecting a parcel delivery later today.','milk/fuel/pizza etc delivery I gave the kids some money for a pizza delivery.','a delivery date/time The normal delivery time is 7 – 10 days after you place your order.','a delivery service We try to maintain a high standard of delivery service to our customers.','a delivery charge (= an amount of money you pay for delivery ) There’s no delivery charge on goods over £20.','a delivery note (= piece of paper showing the details of your order ) A delivery note is sent along with the goods.','a delivery truck ( also delivery van British English ) Just then a delivery truck stopped outside.','a delivery man (= man who delivers goods to people ) He got a job as a delivery man for a hardware store.','do a delivery We usually do the deliveries in the morning.','make a delivery I’m afraid we don’t make deliveries on Saturdays.','offer delivery We offer free, next-day delivery on all orders.','have a delivery We''ve just had a delivery of tiles from Italy.','accept/receive a delivery Someone must be at home to accept the delivery.','take delivery of something The airline has just taken delivery of three new passenger jets.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Most Indian restaurants offer free delivery.","translation":"اکثر رستوران های هندی تحویل رایگان ارائه می دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000816056.mp3"},{"sentence":"You can expect delivery in a week to ten days.","translation":"می توانید انتظار تحویل یک هفته تا ده روز را داشته باشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001684118.mp3"},{"sentence":"fresh milk deliveries","translation":"تحویل شیر تازه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001684119.mp3"},{"sentence":"deliveries of food and supplies","translation":"تحویل مواد غذایی و لوازم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001684122.mp3"},{"sentence":"The restaurant pays cash on delivery for fish, which the local fishermen like.","translation":"این رستوران برای ماهی که ماهیگیران محلی آن را می پسندند، پول نقد پرداخت می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000449.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
