('e321174f-1070-5fcc-a57e-2f0d4e92de63','62e091eb-c947-5dc1-ae19-978cb7fa9ca5',2,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who is in charge of a particular activity or organization',null,null,'کسی که مسئول یک فعالیت یا سازمان خاص است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the director of education","translation":"مدیر آموزش و پرورش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001694811.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('976b8e87-a29d-591a-9abf-b9ccf4b7b0d1','62e091eb-c947-5dc1-ae19-978cb7fa9ca5',3,null,null,'spoken & written','the person who gives instructions to the actors and other people working on a film or play',null,null,'شخصی که به بازیگران و سایر افرادی که روی یک فیلم یا نمایشنامه کار می کنند دستورالعمل می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a film/movie director the film director Stephen Spielberg','a theatre director British English , a theater director American English: Laura Thompson is a theatre director now in the middle of rehearsals for ''Romeo and Juliet''.','an artistic director (= person who controls which plays a theatre produces and how they are produced ) The artistic director announced that a new play would be staged next month.','a musical director He later became musical director of the London Symphony Orchestra.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('7c775245-0833-5bf2-9637-41009e4bb120','60c536a7-df4b-5d9d-b970-f4b0f246362d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who is disabled cannot use a part of their body properly, or cannot learn easily',null,null,'معلول، ناتوان (بدنی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a support group for parents of disabled children","translation":"یک گروه حمایتی برای والدین کودکان معلول","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703670.mp3"},{"sentence":"a severely disabled polio patient","translation":"یک بیمار فلج اطفال با ناتوانی شدید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703671.mp3"},{"sentence":"If you are elderly or physically disabled, massage can be beneficial.","translation":"اگر شما مسن هستید یا از نظر جسمی ناتوان هستید، ماساژ می تواند مفید باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703677.mp3"},{"sentence":"teachers who work with learning disabled children (= children who have problems learning )","translation":"معلمانی که با کودکان کم توان یادگیری کار می کنند (= کودکانی که در یادگیری مشکل دارند)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703678.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('d4f3edc1-b6c0-503b-8fcd-0a5afc9c87c9','60c536a7-df4b-5d9d-b970-f4b0f246362d',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the disabled','معلول، ناتوان (بدنی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('0bf8affa-0fb2-5e89-8827-7bf034f05648','2e3368da-97f6-5b3d-b282-d0e2a2e4705c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to have or express a different opinion from someone else',null,null,'مخالفت کردن، ناهم‌رأی بودن؛ ناهمخوان (با)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He is tolerant of those who disagree with him.","translation":"او با کسانی که با او مخالف هستند مدارا می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000825843.mp3"},{"sentence":"Experts disagree on how much the program will cost.","translation":"کارشناسان در مورد هزینه این برنامه اختلاف نظر دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000825846.mp3"},{"sentence":"Barr strongly disagreed with Kronfeld’s statement.","translation":"بار با اظهارات کرونفلد به شدت مخالف بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703728.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('98d50eb5-a8b2-56f3-9de3-00100b86095b','2e3368da-97f6-5b3d-b282-d0e2a2e4705c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if statements , numbers , or reports about the same event or situation disagree, they are different from each other',null,null,'اگر گزاره‌ها، اعداد یا گزارش‌های مربوط به یک رویداد یا موقعیت با یکدیگر مخالف باشند، با یکدیگر متفاوت هستند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The statements of several witnesses disagree.","translation":"اظهارات چندین شاهد مخالف است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703733.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c138f597-e7e7-50ac-8846-5b2be9c76b38','a48ee42d-ef34-53e5-8447-cae6c0df32bb',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a sudden event such as a flood , storm , or accident which causes great damage or suffering',null,null,'فاجعه، مصیبت؛ شکست فجیع','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a natural disaster (= caused by nature ) In recent years there has been an increase in weather-related natural disasters.','an ecological/environmental disaster (= causing great damage to nature ) This region is facing an ecological disaster as a result of toxic waste.','an air/rail disaster (= an air or rail accident ) The crash was the worst rail disaster in Pakistan’s history.','a nuclear disaster (= an accident involving nuclear power or weapons ) A conflict could get out of hand and degenerate into nuclear disaster.','a terrible disaster It was a terrible disaster which carried away a large part of the hillside.','a disaster strikes (= happens suddenly ) Congress often gives millions of dollars in foreign aid when natural disasters strike.','prevent/avert a disaster They called for an international programme to prevent the disaster happening again.','a disaster area/zone (= area where a disaster has happened ) Military planes flew food supplies to the disaster area.','disaster relief (= money, food, clothes etc for people in a disaster area ) an emergency appeal for disaster relief','a disaster victim (= someone who is suffering because of a disaster ) Aid is being given to the disaster victims.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"One hundred and twenty people died in China’s worst air disaster .","translation":"صد و بیست نفر در بدترین فاجعه هوایی چین جان باختند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000827141.mp3"},{"sentence":"the economic consequences of the Chernobyl nuclear disaster","translation":"پیامدهای اقتصادی فاجعه هسته ای چرنوبیل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001962134.mp3"},{"sentence":"The oil spill was a disaster for Alaskan sea animals.","translation":"نشت نفت یک فاجعه برای حیوانات دریایی آلاسکا بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703841.mp3"},{"sentence":"The 1987 hurricane was the worst natural disaster to hit England for decades.","translation":"طوفان 1987 بدترین فاجعه طبیعی بود که برای چندین دهه انگلستان را درنوردید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000827145.mp3"},{"sentence":"Their expedition nearly ended in disaster , when one of the climbers slid off the mountain.","translation":"سفر آنها تقریباً با فاجعه به پایان رسید، زمانی که یکی از کوهنوردان از کوه سر خورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001962137.mp3"},{"sentence":"The drought could spell disaster for wildlife.","translation":"خشکسالی می تواند یک فاجعه برای حیات وحش باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703842.mp3"},{"sentence":"Disaster struck when two men were killed during their parachute jumps.","translation":"فاجعه زمانی رخ داد که دو مرد در حین پرش با چتر نجات کشته شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703851.mp3"},{"sentence":"The peace process was on the brink of disaster .","translation":"روند صلح در آستانه فاجعه بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001963810.mp3"},{"sentence":"Luckily the pilot saw the other plane just in time, and a disaster was narrowly averted .","translation":"خوشبختانه خلبان هواپیمای دیگر را به موقع دید و از یک فاجعه به سختی جلوگیری شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001962145.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('94bb0f2e-878c-5425-a3ae-b4625a9b0583','a48ee42d-ef34-53e5-8447-cae6c0df32bb',2,null,null,'spoken & written','something that is very bad or a failure , especially when this is very annoying or disappointing',null,null,'چیزی که بسیار بد یا شکست است، به خصوص زمانی که بسیار آزاردهنده یا ناامیدکننده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Because of the weather, the parade was a total disaster.","translation":"به دلیل آب و هوا، رژه یک فاجعه کامل بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000827155.mp3"},{"sentence":"The evening was an unmitigated disaster (= a complete failure ) .","translation":"غروب یک فاجعه غیر قابل کاهش (= شکست کامل) بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703858.mp3"},{"sentence":"The cuts in funding will be a disaster for the schools.","translation":"کاهش بودجه برای مدارس یک فاجعه خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703857.mp3"},{"sentence":"Five small boys on skis is a recipe for disaster (= is very likely to end badly ) .","translation":"پنج پسر کوچک روی اسکی دستوری برای فاجعه است (= به احتمال زیاد پایان بدی دارد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001830962.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('0a1dbe3e-77a7-5f37-9946-59c3b90b1923','0f3365ef-929f-5fa3-97ff-9ebcedcbcc68',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a reduction in the usual price of something',null,null,'تخفیف، تنزیل','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['get/receive a discount You get a discount if you book more than ten tickets.','give (somebody) a discount Many theatres give discounts to students.','offer (somebody) a discount Lenders may offer a discount on larger loans.','ask for a discount I asked for a discount because the vase was slightly damaged.','be entitled to a discount (= have the right to get a discount ) Staff are entitled to a 20% discount.','a special discount Some of the hotels offer special discounts during the winter.','a big/small discount If you spend over £50, you get a big discount.','a substantial/good discount (= a fairly big one ) Insurance companies give substantial discounts to mature drivers.','a 10%/40% etc discount The magazine is offering readers a 15% discount on its subscription fees.','a discount price You can buy books online at discount prices.','a discount fare The bus company offers discount fares to pensioners.','a discount scheme (= system for giving discounts to people ) Many stores operate discount schemes for regular customers.','a discount card The discount card entitles customers to 15% off.','a discount store/shop (= selling things more cheaply than other shops ) There''s a lot of competition from large discount stores.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Members get a 15% discount .","translation":"اعضا از 15 درصد تخفیف برخوردار می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703986.mp3"},{"sentence":"Employees can buy books at a discount.","translation":"کارمندان می توانند کتاب ها را با تخفیف خریداری کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703989.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Young Persons Railcard gives you a discount on rail travel.","translation":"کارت راه آهن جوانان به شما در سفرهای ریلی تخفیف می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703992.mp3"},{"sentence":"discount airfares to Europe","translation":"تخفیف بلیط هواپیما به اروپا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000464.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('7e6c9f6e-4b58-56dc-8116-9e01a0d1dd1e','6b241475-cc29-5e9c-bf9f-b7dcaff74590',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to regard something as unlikely to be true or important',null,null,'تلقی کردن چیزی که بعید است درست یا مهم باشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Experts discounted the accuracy of the polls.","translation":"کارشناسان صحت نظرسنجی ها را رد کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000803017.mp3"},{"sentence":"General Hausken had not discounted the possibility of an aerial attack.","translation":"ژنرال هاوسکن احتمال حمله هوایی را نادیده نگرفته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000803021.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('18b4f9aa-1202-5c2c-806f-cfaf0f4ebf8a','6b241475-cc29-5e9c-bf9f-b7dcaff74590',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to reduce the price of something',null,null,'کاهش قیمت چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Games were discounted to as little as $5.","translation":"بازی ها به اندازه 5 دلار تخفیف داشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002086971.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('eb4328c2-9ba4-5761-b0e7-42555754623a','7285e0e1-a175-55a0-9840-ef1e2e28ac79',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to find someone or something, either by accident or because you were looking for them',null,null,'کشف کردن؛ دریافتن؛ اکتشاف کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The body was discovered in a field.","translation":"جسد در یک مزرعه کشف شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703547.mp3"},{"sentence":"Forest Service crews often discover campfires that have not been put out completely.","translation":"خدمه خدمات جنگل اغلب آتش های کمپ را کشف می کنند که به طور کامل خاموش نشده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703548.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('462587ef-c9dc-57fd-886f-e4eb91239e46','7285e0e1-a175-55a0-9840-ef1e2e28ac79',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to find out something that you did not know about before',null,null,'برای پیدا کردن چیزی که قبلاً در مورد آن نمی دانستید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The exercises let students discover math concepts on their own.","translation":"تمرین ها به دانش آموزان اجازه می دهد تا مفاهیم ریاضی را خودشان کشف کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703549.mp3"},{"sentence":"She discovered that she was pregnant.","translation":"او متوجه شد که باردار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000803182.mp3"},{"sentence":"His friends were shocked to discover how ill he was.","translation":"دوستانش وقتی فهمیدند او چقدر بیمار است شوکه شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000803185.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was discovered that lightning was electrical.","translation":"مشخص شد که صاعقه برقی است.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,4),
('c44fcb82-ab98-5542-b9aa-377e813472fb','7285e0e1-a175-55a0-9840-ef1e2e28ac79',3,null,null,'spoken & written','if someone discovers a new place, fact, substance etc, they are the first person to find it or know that it exists',null,null,'اگر کسی مکان، واقعیت، ماده و غیره جدیدی را کشف کند، اولین کسی است که آن را پیدا می کند یا می داند که وجود دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The Curies are best known for discovering radium.","translation":"کوری ها بیشتر برای کشف رادیوم شناخته شده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000803171.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('12b94826-4e1f-5194-b74e-52afa7f3aaa4','7285e0e1-a175-55a0-9840-ef1e2e28ac79',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to notice or try something for the first time and start to enjoy it',null,null,'متوجه شدن یا امتحان کردن چیزی برای اولین بار و شروع به لذت بردن از آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"At fourteen, Louise discovered boys.","translation":"در چهارده سالگی، لوئیز پسران را کشف کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703556.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('9017747c-32a3-5273-b6c5-cf64b0095879','7285e0e1-a175-55a0-9840-ef1e2e28ac79',5,null,null,'spoken & written','to notice someone who is very good at something and help them to become successful and well known',null,null,'توجه کردن به کسی که در کاری بسیار خوب است و به او کمک می کند تا موفق و شناخته شده شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a band that’s waiting to be discovered","translation":"گروهی که منتظر کشف شدن است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703557.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('031fbd6d-fde6-5f29-a4be-ac141f07c27c','361c7165-bcf9-5664-8cff-024eaf8ad888',1,'amount of space','مقدار فضا','spoken & written','the amount of space between two places or things','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'فاصله، مسافت؛ دور (نقاط)؛ دوری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a long/great/considerable distance The sound of guns seemed a long distance away.','a short distance I quickly walked the short distance to the car.','a safe distance (= enough space to be safe ) You should keep a safe distance from the car in front.','some distance (= quite a long distance ) He heard a scream some distance away.','vast distances The aircraft is able to carry huge loads over vast distances.','the stopping/braking distance (= how far you travel in a car after pressing the brakes ) What’s the stopping distance at 30 miles an hour?','travel a great/long etc distance In some countries children must travel great distances to school each day.','measure the distance between things Now we are able to measure the distances between the planets.','judge distances (= judge how much space there is between things ) Animals that hunt can judge distances very well.','within (easy) walking distance (= near enough to walk to easily ) There are lots of restaurants within walking distance.','within travelling/commuting/driving distance of something (= near enough to make travel to or from a place possible ) The job was not within travelling distance of my home.','within striking distance of something (= not far from something, especially something you are going to attack ) Their troops had advanced to within striking distance of the town.','within spitting distance informal (= very near something ) The ball passed within spitting distance of the goal.','put some distance between yourself and somebody/something (= go quite a long way from them ) He wanted to put some distance between himself and his pursuers.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the distance from Chicago to Detroit","translation":"فاصله شیکاگو تا دیترویت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001147586.mp3"},{"sentence":"Measure the distance between the two points.","translation":"فاصله بین دو نقطه را اندازه بگیرید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001690521.mp3"},{"sentence":"The cottage is some distance (= quite a long distance ) from the road.","translation":"کلبه مقداری فاصله (= فاصله بسیار طولانی) از جاده دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001147594.mp3"},{"sentence":"A shark can smell blood at a distance of half a kilometer.","translation":"یک کوسه در فاصله نیم کیلومتری بوی خون را حس می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001690528.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('39ddd608-0c23-5130-890a-ee71140b51fa','361c7165-bcf9-5664-8cff-024eaf8ad888',2,'far away','خیلی دور','spoken & written','used to talk about a situation when something is far away from you in space or time','[ singular ]',null,'برای صحبت در مورد موقعیتی استفاده می شود که چیزی در مکان یا زمان از شما دور است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a long/great/considerable distance The sound of guns seemed a long distance away.','a short distance I quickly walked the short distance to the car.','a safe distance (= enough space to be safe ) You should keep a safe distance from the car in front.','some distance (= quite a long distance ) He heard a scream some distance away.','vast distances The aircraft is able to carry huge loads over vast distances.','the stopping/braking distance (= how far you travel in a car after pressing the brakes ) What’s the stopping distance at 30 miles an hour?','travel a great/long etc distance In some countries children must travel great distances to school each day.','measure the distance between things Now we are able to measure the distances between the planets.','judge distances (= judge how much space there is between things ) Animals that hunt can judge distances very well.','within (easy) walking distance (= near enough to walk to easily ) There are lots of restaurants within walking distance.','within travelling/commuting/driving distance of something (= near enough to make travel to or from a place possible ) The job was not within travelling distance of my home.','within striking distance of something (= not far from something, especially something you are going to attack ) Their troops had advanced to within striking distance of the town.','within spitting distance informal (= very near something ) The ball passed within spitting distance of the goal.','put some distance between yourself and somebody/something (= go quite a long way from them ) He wanted to put some distance between himself and his pursuers.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Church bells rang in the distance (= they were far away ) .","translation":"ناقوس کلیسا از دور به صدا درآمد (= دور بودند) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001690552.mp3"},{"sentence":"We watched from a distance.","translation":"از دور تماشا می کردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000469.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b43e6d24-f15a-5f55-b68e-42f46f389064','361c7165-bcf9-5664-8cff-024eaf8ad888',3,'unfriendly feeling','احساس غیر دوستانه','spoken & written','a situation in which two people do not have a close friendly relationship','[ singular ]',null,'وضعیتی که در آن دو نفر رابطه دوستانه نزدیکی با هم ندارند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a long/great/considerable distance The sound of guns seemed a long distance away.','a short distance I quickly walked the short distance to the car.','a safe distance (= enough space to be safe ) You should keep a safe distance from the car in front.','some distance (= quite a long distance ) He heard a scream some distance away.','vast distances The aircraft is able to carry huge loads over vast distances.','the stopping/braking distance (= how far you travel in a car after pressing the brakes ) What’s the stopping distance at 30 miles an hour?','travel a great/long etc distance In some countries children must travel great distances to school each day.','measure the distance between things Now we are able to measure the distances between the planets.','judge distances (= judge how much space there is between things ) Animals that hunt can judge distances very well.','within (easy) walking distance (= near enough to walk to easily ) There are lots of restaurants within walking distance.','within travelling/commuting/driving distance of something (= near enough to make travel to or from a place possible ) The job was not within travelling distance of my home.','within striking distance of something (= not far from something, especially something you are going to attack ) Their troops had advanced to within striking distance of the town.','within spitting distance informal (= very near something ) The ball passed within spitting distance of the goal.','put some distance between yourself and somebody/something (= go quite a long way from them ) He wanted to put some distance between himself and his pursuers.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There was still a distance between me and my father.","translation":"هنوز بین من و پدرم فاصله بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001147649.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
