('6573053d-9bcc-53f1-bcde-83a015da82ca','27446b98-ac7e-5a8a-9e3f-9c1e1e66f3b9',1,null,null,'spoken & written','making you feel excited',null,null,'هیجان‌انگیز، تکان‌دهنده','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an exciting opportunity The job offers an exciting career opportunity for the right individual.','an exciting possibility Penny allowed herself to consider the exciting possibility that Jack might be at the party.','an exciting time It was the most exciting time of my life.','an exciting development (= a change that makes a product, situation etc better ) This exciting development could mark the end of the long-running conflict.','an exciting prospect (= an event in the future, about which you feel excited ) For the team, there’s the exciting prospect of travelling to many major cities.','an exciting prospect (= a person who has a good chance of success in the future ) His pace and skill mark him as one of the most exciting prospects in Super League.','find something exciting He found it very exciting to ride a horse at such speed and jump over large obstacles.','sexually exciting The images are sexually exciting.','new and exciting The theme park has many new and exciting rides.','an exciting new something There are many exciting new developments in cancer research.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"an exciting discovery","translation":"یک کشف هیجان انگیز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001226955.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Julia and Paul are getting married!’ ‘Oh, how exciting!’","translation":"«جولیا و پل در حال ازدواج هستند!» «اوه، چقدر هیجان انگیز!»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735169.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve got some very exciting news for you.","translation":"من یک خبر بسیار هیجان انگیز برای شما دارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735170.mp3"},{"sentence":"Let’s do something exciting.","translation":"بیایید یک کار هیجان انگیز انجام دهیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735171.mp3"},{"sentence":"Melanie finds her work exciting and rewarding.","translation":"ملانی کار خود را هیجان انگیز و با ارزش می یابد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735172.mp3"},{"sentence":"exciting job opportunities","translation":"فرصت های شغلی هیجان انگیز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735175.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('efba5530-596c-5d05-bfc1-d93b03d34c4c','1803baac-8308-5380-825f-3ee59fccf268',1,'for health','برای سلامتی','spoken & written','physical activities that you do in order to stay healthy and become stronger','[ uncountable ]',null,'ورزش، تمرین بدنی؛ تمرین (ذهنی)؛ ورزشگاه (صرف)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['do some exercise ( also take some exercise British English ) He ought to do more exercise. He was advised by the doctor to take more exercise.','get some exercise I don’t get enough exercise.','good exercise Swimming is very good exercise for your muscles.','regular/daily exercise Taking regular exercise is the best way to improve your overall health.','physical exercise Physical exercise keeps you fit and helps to reduce stress.','hard/strenuous/vigorous exercise (= involving a lot of physical effort ) Pregnant women should avoid strenuous exercise.','gentle/light/moderate exercise (= not involving too much physical effort ) Try to do some gentle exercise as part of your daily routine.','aerobic exercise (= in which you breathe deeply and your heart beats faster ) Aerobic exercise, such as jogging or cycling, is a great way to burn off fat.','a type/form of exercise This type of exercise is excellent for losing weight.','lack of exercise Children are becoming overweight through lack of exercise.','an exercise programme/routine/regime British English , an exercise program American English (= a plan that includes different types of exercise ) The athletes follow an intensive exercise programme. I’m finding it quite hard to stick to my exercise routine.','an exercise class I usually go to my exercise class on Wednesdays.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Try to fit some regular exercise into your daily routine.","translation":"سعی کنید ورزش منظم را در برنامه روزانه خود قرار دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611784.mp3"},{"sentence":"Working in an office, I don’t get much exercise .","translation":"وقتی در دفتر کار می کنم، زیاد ورزش نمی کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611785.mp3"},{"sentence":"Most people need to do more exercise.","translation":"بیشتر افراد نیاز به ورزش بیشتری دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001228554.mp3"},{"sentence":"Gentle exercise can be beneficial for older people.","translation":"ورزش ملایم می تواند برای افراد مسن مفید باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611792.mp3"},{"sentence":"After the operation, you should avoid strenuous exercise.","translation":"پس از عمل باید از انجام ورزش های سنگین خودداری کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611795.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('25890fad-6983-501a-a8bd-46344552ff54','1803baac-8308-5380-825f-3ee59fccf268',2,'movement','حرکت','spoken & written','a movement or set of movements that you do regularly to keep your body healthy','[ countable ]',null,'یک حرکت یا مجموعه ای از حرکات که به طور منظم برای حفظ سلامت بدن خود انجام می دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"stretching exercises","translation":"تمرینات کششی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001228565.mp3"},{"sentence":"You can do exercises to strengthen your stomach muscles.","translation":"برای تقویت عضلات شکم می توانید تمریناتی انجام دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611796.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('dd45627f-4681-58ca-b8af-da0838ab53a7','1803baac-8308-5380-825f-3ee59fccf268',3,'for a skill','برای یک مهارت','spoken & written','an activity or process that helps you practise a particular skill','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'فعالیت یا فرآیندی که به شما کمک می کند مهارت خاصی را تمرین کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"relaxation exercises","translation":"تمرینات آرامش بخش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001832222.mp3"},{"sentence":"role-play exercises","translation":"تمرینات نقش آفرینی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611806.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('22d06934-14fd-5db8-944e-7fb5af90746e','1803baac-8308-5380-825f-3ee59fccf268',4,'in a book','در یک کتاب','spoken & written','a set of questions in a book that test a student’s knowledge or skill','[ countable ]',null,'مجموعه ای از سوالات در یک کتاب که دانش یا مهارت دانش آموز را می سنجد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Do Exercises 3 and 4 on page 51 for homework.","translation":"تمرینات 3 و 4 صفحه 51 را برای تکالیف انجام دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001228579.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7337b465-289e-5ef9-bfe9-945a85fd0116','1803baac-8308-5380-825f-3ee59fccf268',5,'for a particular result','برای یک نتیجه خاص','spoken & written','an activity or situation that has a particular quality or result','[ singular ]',null,'فعالیت یا موقعیتی که کیفیت یا نتیجه خاصی دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"closing libraries as part of a cost-cutting exercise","translation":"بستن کتابخانه ها به عنوان بخشی از تمرین کاهش هزینه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001228591.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s a pointless exercise.","translation":"این یک تمرین بیهوده است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611807.mp3"},{"sentence":"Buying a house can be an exercise in frustration.","translation":"خرید خانه می تواند تمرینی برای ناامیدی باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611810.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('a4d90276-e4ce-52a4-9587-6c1abd585fba','1803baac-8308-5380-825f-3ee59fccf268',6,'army/navy etc','ارتش / نیروی دریایی و غیره','spoken & written','a set of activities for training soldiers etc','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'مجموعه ای از فعالیت ها برای آموزش سربازان و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a military exercise","translation":"یک تمرین نظامی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001228585.mp3"},{"sentence":"Half the unit was away on exercise.","translation":"نیمی از واحد در تمرین دور بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611813.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('42a80974-8d00-52d0-8215-86cb2c2f6e4f','1803baac-8308-5380-825f-3ee59fccf268',7,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the exercise of something','ورزش، تمرین بدنی؛ تمرین (ذهنی)؛ ورزشگاه (صرف)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('86b4d242-153c-5815-897c-4cced8b753ce','f0a7c620-09e8-5e29-a465-ae5bdce38a30',1,'use something','از چیزی استفاده کن','formal','to use a power, right, or quality that you have','[ transitive ]',null,'به‌کارگیری (قدرت، حق)؛ تمرین کردن؛ ورزش کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"There are plans to encourage people to exercise their right to vote.","translation":"برنامه هایی برای تشویق مردم به استفاده از حق رای خود در نظر گرفته شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001228625.mp3"},{"sentence":"People who can exercise some control over their surroundings feel less anxious.","translation":"افرادی که می توانند بر محیط اطراف خود کنترل داشته باشند کمتر احساس اضطراب می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611822.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
